Package: zuyaml
Title: Parse and Emit YAML 1.2
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Andrew", "Sampson", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "author of the bundled cyaml library")
  )
Description: Converts between YAML 1.2 and ordinary R objects using a
    bundled copy of the 'cyaml' C11 parser and emitter. Handles ambiguous
    YAML features strictly and predictably, including duplicate keys,
    anchors and aliases, and integers beyond double precision, with no
    runtime dependencies beyond R.
